# --- 7 Aug 2026: repo-root markdown noise (Phase 2.1 decision 4) ---
# Orchestrator handoff docs (kickoffs, PRDs, carryovers, build reports) live in the repo
# ROOT, not in the app. Hundreds of them drowned `git status`, which is how an untracked
# ReadmissionsBoard.tsx went unnoticed and shipped a commit that could not build. Ignoring
# them makes an untracked SOURCE file visible again.
# Root-level only (leading slash) — docs/*.md and every in-app .md are unaffected.
# An ignore rule cannot un-track a tracked file, but the `!` lines below are listed anyway
# so that `git add` on them keeps working and no tool that honours .gitignore skips them.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/PORT-NOTES.md
!/CDMSS-MATCHER-SCOPING-AUDIT-REPORT-23-JUL-2026.md
!/CDMSS-MATCHER-STAGE2-DRYRUN-REPORT-23-JUL-2026.md
!/CDMSS-MATCHER-STAGE2B-DOSEGATE-MEASUREMENT-23-JUL-2026.md
!/CDMSS-SIGNAL-TYPE-COLLAPSE-DRYRUN-REPORT-22-JUL-2026.md
!/lvc-attribution-stage1-dryrun.md
!/machinery-payoff-ablation.md
!/source-authority-measurement.md
!/source-authority-postactivation.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-PRD-v2.1-11-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ONPATH-CC-KICKOFF-v11-11-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ONPATH-BUILD-11-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ADDENDUM-v1-13-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-DECISIONS-13-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ADDENDUM-v2-13-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ADDENDUM-v3-13-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ADDENDUM-v4-13-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ADDENDUM-v5-13-AUG-2026.md
!/CDMSS-RERANK-TELEMETRY-ADDENDUM-v6-13-AUG-2026.md
